{"slug":"system-design-url-shortener","wpId":7827,"title":"Url Shortener","category":"system-design","categories":["system-design"],"tags":[],"date":"2019-03-14T16:00:03","modified":"2022-03-14T16:20:38","excerpt":"Here we are going to design a url shortener system. Questions for clear scope Can you give an example of how a URL shortener work? – https://www.systeminterview.com/q=chatsystem&c=loggedin&v=v3&l=long What is the traffic volume? – 100 million URLs are generated per day. How long is the shortened…","url":"/system-design/system-design-url-shortener","contentHtml":"<div class=\"boldgrid-section\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-12 col-xs-12 col-sm-12\">\n<p class=\"\">Here we are going to design a url shortener system.</p>\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Questions for clear scope</strong></p>\n<div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 120\">\n<div class=\"layoutArea\">\n<div class=\"column\">\n<p class=\"\">Can you give an example of how a URL shortener work? – https://www.systeminterview.com/q=chatsystem&amp;c=loggedin&amp;v=v3&amp;l=long</p>\n<div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 120\">\n<div class=\"layoutArea\">\n<div class=\"column\">\n<p class=\"\">What is the traffic volume? – 100 million URLs are generated per day.</p>\n<div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 120\">\n<div class=\"layoutArea\">\n<div class=\"column\">\n<p>How long is the shortened URL? – as short as possible</p>\n<div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 120\">\n<div class=\"layoutArea\">\n<div class=\"column\">\n<p>What characters are allowed in the shortened URL? – Shortened URL can be a combination of numbers (0-9) and characters (a-z, A- Z).</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 120\">\n<div class=\"layoutArea\">\n<div class=\"column\">\n<p class=\"\">Can shortened URLs be deleted or updated? – For simplicity, let us assume shortened URLs cannot be deleted or updated.</p>\n<div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 120\">\n<div class=\"layoutArea\">\n<div class=\"column\">\n<p class=\"\">Here are the basic use cases:</p>\n<ol class=\"\">\n<li>URL shortening: given a long URL =&gt; return a much shorter URL</li>\n<li>URL redirecting: given a shorter URL =&gt; redirect to the original URL</li>\n<li>High availability, scalability, and fault tolerance considerations</li>\n</ol>\n<p class=\"\"><strong>Solution with Base 62 conversion</strong></p>\n<div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 126\">\n<div class=\"layoutArea\">\n<div class=\"column\">\n<p class=\"\">Base conversion is an approach commonly used for URL shorteners. Base conversion helps to convert the same number between its different number representation systems. Base 62 conversion is used as there are 62 possible characters for hashValue.</p>\n<p class=\"\">Conversion of 11157 to base 62</p>\n<p class=\"\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-7836\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"395\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 783px) 100vw, 783px\" src=\"https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.16.03-AM.png\" srcset=\"https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.16.03-AM.png 783w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.16.03-AM.png 300w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.16.03-AM.png 768w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.16.03-AM.png 250w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.16.03-AM.png 550w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.16.03-AM.png 357w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.16.03-AM.png 595w\" width=\"783\"/></p>\n<p class=\"\">The short url is https://tinyurl.com/2TX</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-7833\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"562\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 868px) 100vw, 868px\" src=\"https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.08.08-AM.png\" srcset=\"https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.08.08-AM.png 868w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.08.08-AM.png 300w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.08.08-AM.png 768w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.08.08-AM.png 250w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.08.08-AM.png 550w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.08.08-AM.png 800w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.08.08-AM.png 278w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.08.08-AM.png 463w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.08.08-AM.png 772w\" width=\"868\"/></p>\n<div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 128\">\n<div class=\"layoutArea\">\n<div class=\"column\">\n<ol class=\"\">\n<li>longURL is the input.</li>\n<li>The system checks if the longURL is in the database.</li>\n<li>If it is, it means the longURL was converted to shortURL before. In this case, fetch the shortURL from the database and return it to the client.</li>\n<li>If not, the longURL is new. A new unique ID (primary key) Is generated by the unique ID generator.</li>\n<li>Convert the ID to shortURL with base 62 conversion.</li>\n<li>Create a new database row with the ID, shortURL, and longURL.</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 128\">\n<div class=\"layoutArea\">\n<div class=\"column\">\n<p class=\"\">To make the flow easier to understand, let us look at a concrete example.</p>\n<ul class=\"\">\n<li>Assuming the input longURL is: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Systems_design • Unique ID generator returns ID: 2009215674938.</li>\n<li>Convert the ID to shortURL using the base 62 conversion. ID (2009215674938) is converted to “zn9edcu”.</li>\n<li>Save ID, shortURL, and longURL to the database</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-7835\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"152\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 853px) 100vw, 853px\" src=\"https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.09.51-AM.png\" srcset=\"https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.09.51-AM.png 853w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.09.51-AM.png 300w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.09.51-AM.png 768w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.09.51-AM.png 250w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.09.51-AM.png 550w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.09.51-AM.png 800w\" width=\"853\"/></p>\n<p class=\"\">Comparison of Hash solution vs Base 62 conversion</p>\n<p class=\"\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-7837\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"472\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 823px) 100vw, 823px\" src=\"https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.17.49-AM.png\" srcset=\"https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.17.49-AM.png 823w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.17.49-AM.png 300w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.17.49-AM.png 768w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.17.49-AM.png 250w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.17.49-AM.png 550w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.17.49-AM.png 800w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.17.49-AM.png 314w, https://d2q2snz6diubfd.cloudfront.net/media/2019/03/Screen-Shot-2022-03-14-at-10.17.49-AM.png 523w\" width=\"823\"/></p>\n<p>As you can see Base 62 conversion is the clear winner.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"\"> </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n","toc":[],"wordCount":334,"readingMinutes":2,"status":"published"}